cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  The catalogue was developed as part of Bronikowski et al. (2025). If you use
  it, please cite that paper (below) and the original papers for any lens model
  you use.
title: "cluster-models: a curated database of galaxy-cluster strong-lensing models"
type: dataset
